{
  "id": "E151",
  "title": "Cats or Dogs?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-09-24",
  "synopsis": "Learn about what your animal says about you.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/527/82020155c3f293db2ad6b6cebfdc77fd77d1f39a.mp3?1505761115",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你喜欢猫还是喜欢狗？\n\n    猫和狗都是很可爱的动物。猫更安静独立，喜欢自己睡觉、自己玩，不会一直跟人在一起。狗更热情友好，总是喜欢跟人一起散步、一起玩。有人说，喜欢猫的人更内向；喜欢狗的人更外向。你喜欢猫还是喜欢狗呢？",
    "traditional": "你喜歡貓還是喜歡狗？\n\n    貓和狗都是很可愛的動物。貓更安靜獨立，喜歡自己睡覺、自己玩，不會一直跟人在一起。狗更熱情友好，總是喜歡跟人一起散步、一起玩。有人說，喜歡貓的人更內向；喜歡狗的人更外向。你喜歡貓還是喜歡狗呢？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you like cats or dogs?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "猫和狗都是很可爱的动物。",
      "traditional": "貓和狗都是很可愛的動物。",
      "pinyin": "māo hé gǒu dōu shì hěn kě ài de dòng wù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "猫更安静独立，",
      "traditional": "貓更安靜獨立，",
      "pinyin": "māo gèng ān jìng dú lì",
      "english": "Cats and dogs are both very cute animals."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "喜欢自己睡觉、自己玩，不会一直跟人在一起。",
      "traditional": "喜歡自己睡覺、自己玩，不會一直跟人在一起。",
      "pinyin": "xǐ huan zì jǐ shuì jiào zì jǐ wán bú huì yì zhí gēn rén zài yì qǐ",
      "english": "Cats are more quiet and independent."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "狗更热情友好，总是喜欢跟人一起散步、一起玩。",
      "traditional": "狗更熱情友好，總是喜歡跟人一起散步、一起玩。",
      "pinyin": "gǒu gèng rè qíng yǒu hǎo zǒng shì xǐ huan gēn rén yì qǐ sàn bù yì qǐ wán",
      "english": "They like to sleep or play by themselves, not always being together with people."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "有人说，喜欢猫的人更内向；喜欢狗的人更外向。",
      "traditional": "有人說，喜歡貓的人更內向；喜歡狗的人更外向。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu rén shuō xǐ huan māo de rén gèng nèi xiàng xǐ huan gǒu de rén gèng wài xiàng",
      "english": "Dogs are more enthusiastic and friendly. They always like to go out and play with people."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "你喜欢猫还是喜欢狗呢？",
      "traditional": "你喜歡貓還是喜歡狗呢？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ xǐ huan māo hái shi xǐ huan gǒu ne",
      "english": "It is said that people who like cats are more conservative and people who like dogs are more outgoing."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you like cats or dogs?"
    }
  ],
